<p><a href="security.html"><img style="vertical-align: middle; " src="../../images/navprev.png"/></a> <a href="security.html">Security Features</a> | <a href="index.html"><img style="vertical-align: middle; " src="../../images/navtop.png"/></a> <a href="index.html">Contents</a> | <a href="secbackend.html">Back-End Encryption and Secure Authentication</a> <a href="secbackend.html"><img style="vertical-align: middle; " src="../../images/navnext.png"/></a></p>

<br/><a name="frontendencryption"/><h1>Front-End Encryption and Secure Authentication</h1>

<p>When configured to use the SQLRClient protocol (the default), SQL Relay supports <a href="sqlrclientprotocol.html#sqlrclientkrb">Kerberos and Active Directory Encryption and Authentication</a> and <a href="sqlrclientprotocol.html#sqlrclienttls">TLS/SSL Encryption and Authentication</a> between the client and SQL Relay server.</p>

<blockquote>
<img src="../../images/secure-krb-sqlrclient-unsecured.png"/>
<img style="padding-left: 40px; " src="../../images/secure-tls-sqlrclient-unsecured.png"/>
</blockquote>
<p>When configured to use the MySQL protocol, SQL Relay supports <a href="mysqlprotocol.html#mysqltls">TLS/SSL Encryption and Authentication</a> between the client and SQL Relay server.</p>

<blockquote>
<img src="../../images/secure-tls-mysql-unsecured.png"/>
</blockquote>
<p>When configured to use the PostgreSQL protocol, SQL Relay supports <a href="postgresqlprotocol.html#postgresqltls">TLS/SSL Encryption and Authentication</a> between the client and SQL Relay server.</p>

<blockquote>
<img src="../../images/secure-tls-postgresql-unsecured.png"/>
</blockquote>
<p>When configured to use the Firebird protocol, SQL Relay supports Firebird <a href="firebirdprotocol.html#firebirdwirecrypt">Wire Encryption</a> between the client and SQL Relay server.</p>

<blockquote>
<img src="../../images/secure-wire-firebird-unsecured.png"/>
</blockquote>
<p>When configured to use the TDS protocol, SQL Relay supports <a href="tdsprotocol.html#tdstls">TLS/SSL Encryption and Authentication</a> between the client and SQL Relay server.</p>

<blockquote>
<img src="../../images/secure-tls-tds-unsecured.png"/>
</blockquote>
<hr/>

